        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga w'e Assiria yaasengula abantu okubatoola mu bibuga, Babiloni, ni Kutha, ni Avva, ni Hamathi, ni Sefarivaimu. Yaabatwala okubasenza mu bibuga bya Samaria, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mu bibuga bya Samaria:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Eriina ery'ekibuga ekikulu Samaria lyakozesebwanga okutegeeza ekiketezo ekyali eky'obwakyabazinga bwa Isiraeli, Abassiria kye baasengamu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mu kifo ky'Abaisiraeli. Abantu abo baatwala ensi Samaria yaaba yaibwe, baabanga mu bibuga byayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe baali nga baakatoolera okubaayo, tibaasinzanga Musengwa Katonda. N'olw'ekyo Musengwa Katonda oyo kyeyava n'abasindikira empologoma ni dhibaitamu abandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaabaagho abaakobera kyabazinga w'e Assiria bati: “Abantu be watwala okubasenza mu bibuga by'e Samaria, tibaidhi mateeka ga musambwa gwa mu nsi eyo. N'olw'ekyo omusambwa ogwo kye gwava ni gubasindikira empologoma, era dhiri eyo dhiri kubaita.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga w'e Assiria yaalagira ati: “Mutwaleyo owundi ku bakabona be mwatoolayo aje abenga eyo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:27",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "aje abenga eyo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu Luheburayi kiri nti “Baje babenga eyo”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " abeegerese amateeka ag'omusambwa gw'omu nsi eyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho owundi ku bakabona be baatoola mu Samaria, yaaja yaabanga e Betheli, yaabeegeresanga bwe bagwaine okutyanga Musengwa Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
